  "prefLabel": "He-W 574.11 Hearings",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 574.11 Hearings. Any recipient who has been denied reimbursement for non-emergency medical transportation services may appeal an adverse decision by requesting a fair hearing in accordance with He-C 200. Requests for fair hearings shall be submitted no later than 30 days after the date the notice of decision being appealed is issued.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading He-W 500); ss by #6163, eff 1-4-96, EXPIRED: 1-4-04\n\nNew. #8732, eff 9-30-06; ss by #10810, eff 4-9-15; ss by #14393, eff 10-1-25, EXPIRES: 10-1-35",
